{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/items/117043/", "pk": 117043, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/", "pk": 32820, "shortname": "gocartours-sandiego", "name": "GoCar Tours San Diego", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "GoCar: San Diego Full Day Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 11, "unicode": "GoCar: San Diego Full Day Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.5, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.5, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 5500, "description": "##You want to see it all, every little square inch of wonderful San Diego. We at GoCar San Diego get that, which is why we now offer the true Deal of the Century! The all day Everything Tour. Take the car out from open to close and have fun.*\n\n*(All GoCars Hold 2 People)*\n\n## Duration\n8 Hours\n\n## About\nThe all day Everything Tour is fun for the whole family, and lets you see nearly everything San Diego has to offer. From the historic Gaslamp Quarter where the fun is always happening and the iconic Horton Plaza where the shopping is just as fun as navigating the mall. You will see the beautiful rose garden of Balboa Park and the natural Beauty of the Point Loma Ecological preserve where you can wade through the tide pools looking at sea anemones, crabs, lobster, fish and the occasional octopus. You can walk around Ocean Beach and San Diego’s famous Maritime Museum, experience the always beautiful Balboa park where a Family photo is a must, and stroll through Old Town San Diego and see how San Diego has changed over the centuries from the small Mission and Mexican community it was to the Most Beautiful City in America. You want to see everything San Diego has to offer, and after numerous requests we now have it, the ultimate tour.\n\n**Tour Highlights:**\n\n- Little Italy\n- Maritime museum\n- U.S.S. Midway\n- Seaport Village\n- Horton Plaza\n- Historic Gaslamp Quarter\n- Petco Park\n- Bankers Hill\n- Balboa Park\n- San Diego Zoo\n- Hillcrest\n- Mission Hills\n- Fort Stockton\n- Persidio Park\n- Old Town\n- Shelter Island\n- View of the Naval Attack Submarine base\n- Fort Rosecrans National Cemetery\n- Cabrillo Nation Monument\n- Tide pools\n- Point Loma Light house\n- Point Loma Ecological Reserve\n- Sunset Cliffs\n- Ocean Beach\n\n**Conditions**\n\n- GoCars hold a maximum of 2 people. Prices are per GoCar, not per person.\n- Must be 21 years or older to rent. Must possess a major credit card and valid driver’s license (international license is not necessary). GoCars do not accommodate car seats for children.\n- On the day of rental, a security deposit will be held on your credit card until the GoCar is returned. All riders must sign a standard participant agreement. Renters will have the option to purchase Collision Damage Waiver (CDW) insurance on the day of rental.\n- Renters are free to extend the length of their tour on the day of rental. Additional rental time will be charged in 15-minute increments.\n- Cars must be returned to rental location before dusk.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Please arrive at least 15 min before your scheduled departure time. \n\n-Departure times are approximated due to customers prior to your reservation possibly taking longer than they were booked for.\n\n- If you wish to keep your car longer than what you have booked for, you are welcome, but please check that it is available for you to keep and not needed by another renter. \n\n- Additional time is charged in 15 minute increments at our standard internet rates. \n\n- Please make sure you return the car before we close. Late returns are billed at $1 per minute. Please check with staff on day of rental the close time of the location. Early returns will not be refunded for unused time.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "8 Hours • All day rental for the price of 5 hours! • Must be 21+ to rent", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/items/117043/images/998942/", "pk": 998942, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/zyRdWpRxTHqbrDLTSSLc", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/zyRdWpRxTHqbrDLTSSLc", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/items/117043/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/zyRdWpRxTHqbrDLTSSLc", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/zyRdWpRxTHqbrDLTSSLc", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/items/117043/images/652966/", "pk": 652966, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/zSdsJkvrRuGQe4u7svEw", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/zSdsJkvrRuGQe4u7svEw", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sa